**Concern #1: Robustness of URSL**

In Appendix B.3, we described our approach to choosing the hyper-parameters. We held out a validation set and searched over different values for hyper-parameters. Table 7 shows different values for hyperparameters, among which we performed the search. Finally, we reported the best values in Table 8.

We believe that the hyperparameters are robust because as opposed to other papers like Co$^2$l [1] that report specific parameters for each specific scenario and setting, our model uses the same hyperparameters for all different scenarios.

&nbsp;

[1] Cha, H., Lee, J., & Shin, J. (2021). Co2l: Contrastive continual learning. In Proceedings of the IEEE/CVF International Conference on Computer Vision (pp. 9516-9525).

&nbsp;

